        "name": "Тело запроса",
        "func": "const DATABASE_ID = \"3ec933213ac58090be0aeae9a451804b\";\n\nmsg.url = \"https://api.notion.com/v1/pages\";\nmsg.headers = {\n    \"Notion-Version\": \"2022-06-28\",\n    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n};\nmsg.payload = {\n    parent: { database_id: DATABASE_ID },\n    properties: {\n        Name: { title: [{ text: { content: \"Gavrilik lab2 \" + new Date().toISOString() } }] },\n        Value: { number: Math.floor(Math.random() * 100) },\n        Author: { rich_text: [{ text: { content: \"Gavrilik, группа ИИ\" } }] }\n    }\n};\nreturn msg;",
